lagpipe synctab repair map (internal)

- relc/input.c — chooses layout input for synctab
- tblw/emit_writer.c — writes synctab_out/layout.tbl from the picked layout
- tagc/gate.c — records whether bundled snapshots are acceptable
- synclink/field_emit.c — reads captures using stamp offsets

